response.value:
`display: flex` centers **children inside an element**. The canvas doesn’t have children to center, so those flex properties won’t position the canvas itself.

To center it horizontally, try making the canvas a block and giving it automatic side margins:

```css
#gameCanvas {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
}
```

Keep the border rule too. That should center the canvas across the page.

